{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "3A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/teng-wen-gong-i", "title": "滕文公上", "description": "滕文公為世子，將之楚，過宋而見孟子。孟子道性善，言必稱堯舜。\n世子自楚反，復見孟子。孟子曰：「世子疑吾言乎？夫道一而已矣。成覸謂齊景公曰：『彼丈夫也，我丈夫也，吾何畏彼哉？』顏淵曰：『舜何人也？予何人也？有為者亦若是。』公明儀曰：『文王我師也，周公豈欺我哉？』今滕，絕長補短，將五十里也，猶可以為善國。《書》曰：『若藥不", "occurrences": 8, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "variants": [], "id": "仁"}, {"form": "先", "id": "先"}, {"form": "入", "id": "入"}, {"form": "反", "id": "反"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "官", "id": "官"}, {"form": "掩", "id": "掩"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "易", "id": "易"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "泚", "id": "泚"}, {"form": "用", "id": "用"}, {"form": "界", "id": "界"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "禽獸", "id": "禽獸"}, {"form": "經", "id": "經"}, {"form": "聖人", "id": "聖人"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "親", "id": "親"}, {"form": "變", "id": "變"}, {"form": "賢", "id": "賢"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.9041650800285006, "source": "政", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.6164830075767194, "source": "政", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.9041650800285006, "source": "政", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 2.211017899468555, "source": "政", "target": "界"}, {"weight": 2.211017899468555, "source": "政", "target": "經"}, {"weight": 0.41925843024050014, "source": "政", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.498699971920336, "source": "政", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 2.211017899468555, "source": "政", "target": "聖人"}, {"weight": 1.1124056108004454, "source": "天下", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.4000876832522264, "source": "天下", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.9390841839849136, "source": "天下", "target": "易"}, {"weight": 1.4000876832522264, "source": "事", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 1.8055527913603908, "source": "事", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.8055527913603908, "source": "事", "target": "聖人"}, {